# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Something to hear, after a kernel tone (aocplay=S at the AoC's start, ~47 s in, holds the AoC for S seconds: Darwin's
# sound played meanwhile is lost): SpringBoard up, 40 s, then a tone of three seconds (1000 Hz left, 440 Hz right), the
# lock sound, a keyboard click and a fanfare -- twice, 10 s apart.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard wait 40 tone 3 wait 3 system 1100 wait 3 system 1104 wait 3 file /System/Library/Audio/UISounds/New/Fanfare.caf wait 10 tone 3 wait 3 system 1100 wait 3 system 1104 wait 3 file /System/Library/Audio/UISounds/New/Fanfare.caf
/bin/ps -A
